  "body": "Replaces #296 by @austin62jake (their commits kept as authored) with main merged in - the fork refused maintainer pushes.\n\nResolution: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs` (module list: `post_refusal` and main's `machines_pane` both registered) and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs` (test module list: `post_refusal` and main's `gcode_viewer` both kept) - keep both sides. `shell.rs` and `state.rs` merged automatically (both `post_refusal` and `machines_pane` fields/draw calls present).\n\nTargeted gate (CWD crates/ui): `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- post_refusal machines_pane gcode_viewer` - 9 passed, 0 failed (4 post_refusal, 3 machines_pane, 2 gcode_viewer); `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` - clean.\n\nRefs #265.\n\nChangelog: A refused post's reason stays on screen in a \"Post refused\" window until you close it, post successfully, or switch documents, instead of vanishing at the next click (#265)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
